=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Romell Ariana](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/romell-ariana/312190/project \"Romell Ariana\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Chandak Greenairy project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-chandak-greenairy-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Chandak Greenairy](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-greenairy/152458/project \"Chandak Greenairy\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![DGS Sheetal Regalia project in Borivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-dgs-sheetal-regalia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [DGS Sheetal Regalia](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dgs-sheetal-regalia/211807/project \"DGS Sheetal Regalia\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Romell Ariana Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Romell Ariana located at Borivali West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI marketed Romell Ariana to all for cosy with luxurious homes. The amenities, like rooftop pool, indoor games, etc. make it extremely desirable.\n\nOwner\n\nComfortable 2 BHK carpet is just right for family size. Amenities enhance social living.\n\nOwner\n\nEnjoyed rooftop pool & gym are perfect for a busy lifestyle. Proximity to metro & Link Road provides travel convenience.\n\nOwner\n\nWith metro, highways, schools in the vicinity and a reliable developer, I see strong appeal.\n\nOwner\n\nPrice appears reasonable by Borivali West standards. Lacks 3 BHK option. It discourages larger families.\n\n## Romell Group Track Record\n\n![Romell Group logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/romell-group-1331.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nRomell Group is one of Mumbai’s biggest realty players, starting its journey from 1982 onwards. Vile East Road is where its corporate office is situated while the portfolio of Romell Group projects covers several landmark residential projects across diverse locations. Affordable homes are offered to buyers along with premium luxury apartments here. Several iconic buildings have been built over the years with key emphasis on strategic locations, premium amenities, unmatched quality, aesthetic appeal and overall convenience. Several properties are also being built at present by the Group. Designs draw deeply from contemporary elegance in tandem with spirituality. Architectural innovation drives all development coupled with seamless construction management. There is a skilled workforce that attends to virtually any need along with serving customers impeccably. Superb planning, reliability, stringent quality standards, well connected areas, transparency in business dealings, integrity are core values that are religiously adhered to. Major offerings include Diva, Umiya Grandeur, Aether, etc.\n\n![Romell Espalier residential project in Vile Parle East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-espalier-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVile Parle East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.02 Cr to 5.85 Cr\n\n![Romell Asrava residential project in Andheri West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-asrava-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAndheri West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.73 Cr to 3.66 Cr\n\n![Romell Empress Phase II residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-romell-empress-phase-ii-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.54 Cr to 1.62 Cr\n\n![Romell Bliss residential project in Andheri East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn