-residencies-project-project-large-image1-9412.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.30 Cr to 3.36 Cr\n\n![Bhoomi Shivam residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/bhoomi-shivam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 92.00 Lac to 1.39 Cr\n\n![Hirani Ruby CHS residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/hirani-ruby-chs-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.15 Cr to 1.65 Cr\n\n![Ashutosh Apartment Vazira residential project in Vazira](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ashutosh-apartment-vazira-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVazira, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Chaitanya Radha Madhav residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/chaitanya-radha-madhav-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.22 Cr to 1.90 Cr\n\n## Resale Listings in Romell Ariana\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Romell Ariana, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Ariana in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![YOGESH BAPU GHADIGAONKAR  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Romell Ariana in Ic Colony, Mumbai]()\n\nIc Colony, Mumbai\n\nReal Estate\n\n![Yogesh Bapu Ghadigaonkar]()\n\nAaradhya Fortune Pvt Ltd\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Romell Ariana\n\n### What is the configuration and size of units?\n\nRomell Ariana offers only 2 BHK apartments, with carpet areas between 700 and 741 sq ft, and no studio.\n\n### Where is it situated and how easily accessible is it?\n\nLocated at Shubhjivan Circle off New Link Road in IC Colony, it's 160 m from the road, 350 m from Mandapeshwar Metro, and easily accessible from Borivali station (12 min) and Western Express Highway.\n\n### When is possession and is it RERA-approved?\n\nRegistered as P51800078433, possession is planned for December 2028 (some sources state Dec 2027).\n\n### What are the amenities?\n\nA good value for money package include rooftop swimming pool, fitness centre/gym, indoor games, kids play area, jogging/multipurpose courts, party deck, sky deck, and covered parking.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/home-loan.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/valuation.png)\n![](/assets/images/new-dotcom-services-icons/sell-or-rent-property.png)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n![Lodha](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg)\n![Kalpataru](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg)\n![Hiranandani](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/hiranandani-451.jpg)\n![Runwal](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg)\n![Rustomjee](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg)\n![Mayfair Housing](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mayfair-housing-585.jpg)\n![Godrej](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/godrej-49-2414.jpg)\n![Chandak](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/chandak-1050.jpg)\n![Mahindra Lifespaces](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mahindra-lifespaces-68.jpg)\n![Shapoorji Pallonji](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/shapoorji-pallonji-494.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Vian](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-vian-project-project-large-image1-5543-opt-460392f9-2d11-4a1c-b830-fba5e810b682.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Ahana](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-ahana-project-project-large-image1-4621-opt-3fdf8c3f-c784-42fd-b0f5-4398c6901234.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Purva Estrella](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/purva-estrella-project-project-large-image1-3989-opt-3a6c3ad5-4526-45bf-b146-a3e451ce03ed.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Adani Linkbay Residences](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/adani-linkbay-residences-project-project-large-image1-2560.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Marina 64](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-marina-64-project-project-large-image1-2484.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Mahindra Rainforest](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mahindra-rainforest-project-project-large-image1-5108-opt-1de55a7d-9847-4c14-bd04-8125e6d5a57d.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Meadows](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-meadows-project-project-large-image1-8749-opt-0576b543-8352-4304-ab97-6c63b05f3057.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![GHP Mars Suncity](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ghp-mars-suncity-project-project-large-image1-7362.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![Runwal Bliss](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-bliss-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![LnT Elixir Reserve](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lnt-elixir-reserve-project-project-large-image1-6960.jpg?aio=w-109;h-109;crop;)\n![voice search]()\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.homebazaar.com/paradigm-ariana-residency-borivali-2298","title":"Paradigm Ariana Residency, Borivali Mumbai: 1 BHK Apartments from Rs. 82.34 L","raw_content":"Last updated : May 14 2026\n\n# Paradigm Ariana Residency Borivali\n\n##### Borivali, Western Mumbai\n\n#### 1 BHK\n\n##### Configuration\n\n#### ₹ 82.34 L\n\n##### Onwards\n\n371 to 380 Sq.ft\n\n##### Carpet Area\n\n![Paradigm Ariana Residency Borivali - Elevation](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/658fb997208e7_arianaresidency6.webp?tr=w-692,h-431)\n\nFloor Plans\n\nStreet View\n\n![Paradigm Ariana Residency Borivali - Street View](/static/images/gallery/streetview-thumbnail.webp?tr=w-145,h-125)\n\nStreet View\n\n![Paradigm Ariana Residency Borivali - Unit Floor Plans](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/floorplans/01731307683.webp?tr=w-145,h-125)\n\nUnit Floor Plans\n\n![Paradigm Ariana Residency Borivali - Sample Flat Image](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/658fb995e4238_arianaresidency2.webp?tr=w-145,h-125)\n\nSample Flat Image\n\n![Paradigm Ariana Residency - Elevation](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/658fb997208e7_arianaresidency6.webp?tr=w-295,h-185)\n\nPhotos\n\n## Highlights of Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\n![Airport](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/heighlighticon.webp)CSMI Airport\n\nConveniently located only 26 minutes away.\n\n![Railway Station](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/heighlighticon.webp)Borivali Railway Station\n\nQuick access is only 8 minutes away.\n\n![Metro Station](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/heighlighticon.webp)Devipada Metro Station\n\nJust 4 minutes from the property.\n\n![Highway](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/heighlighticon.webp)Western Express Highway\n\nEasily accessible within 1 minutes.\n\n* The project offers 1 BHK homes.\n* Carpet area from 371 to 380 sq.ft\n* The development spans across a 4-acre land parcel.\n* 73-storey residential buildings.\n* St. John’s High School is 7 minutes away.\n* Thakur College is 9 minutes away.\n* Apex Multispeciality Hospitals is 5 minutes away.\n* Sky City Mall is 4 minutes away.\n* Sanjay Gandhi National Park is 9 minutes away.\n\n## Overview of Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\n### Number of Storey's\n\n73 Storeys\n\n### Configurations\n\n1 BHK\n\n### Carpet Area\n\n371 to 380 Sq.ft\n\n### Project Area\n\n4 Acres\n\n### Starting Price Range\n\n82.34 L onwards\n\n### Construction Status\n\nReady Possession\n\n### EMI Starts At\n\n### Investment Rating\n\n9/10\n\n### Livability Rating\n\n9/10\n\n### Project Rera Number\n\n## Pricing & Floor Plans of Paradigm Ariana Residency, Borivali\n\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price | Floorplan | Room sizes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 371 Sq.ft | ₹ 82.34 L | [ View Now ] | [ View Now ] |\n| 1 BHK | 380 Sq.ft | ₹ 84.27 L | [ View Now ] | [ View Now ] |\n| 1 BHK | 376 Sq.ft | ₹ 82.98 L | [ View Now ] | [ View Now ] |\n\n![Get The Best Quote](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/best-quote.svg \"Get The Best Quote\")\n\n![Getcostsheet](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/common-icons-hb.webp)Get Cost Sheet\n\n![street view](../static/images/street-view-img.svg)\n\n## Street View of Paradigm Ariana Residency, Borivali\n\nExplore the Street View and vibrant surroundings ofParadigm Ariana Residency, right from the comfort of your screen.\n\nWatch Now\n\n## Location Map of Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\nDiscover the location of Paradigm Ariana Residencywith seamless connectivity and nearby landmarks.\n\n![zoom](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/common-icons-hb.webp \"zoom\")\n\n## About Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\nAriana Residency in Borivali East, Western Mumbai is a magnificent address that is packed with highly luxurious homes and matchless features. This project offers 1 Bhk apartments that have the finest fittings. Additionally, you can enjoy an expansive spectrum of modern lifestyle amenities in Ariana Residency such as a Gym, Yoga/Meditation Zone, Landscape Garden, Vast Play Area For Kids, Jogging Track, so much more. Hence, Ariana Residency in Borivali East, Western Mumbai is the most sought-after destination, and it guarantees to match your desires.\n\n## Paradigm Ariana Residency Amenities\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nClub house\n\nConference Room\n\nJogging Track\n\nSports Courts\n\nKids Play Area\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nYoga Zone\n\nFitness Corner\n\nGym\n\nAmphitheater\n\n## Paradigm Ariana Residency Facilities\n\nIntercom\n\nInternet / WiFi\n\nLift\n\nGas Pipeline\n\nPower Back Up\n\nWater Harvest\n\nParking\n\nSecurity System\n\n## Specifications\n\n### Floor\n\nLiving/Dining/BedroomVitrified Tiles\n\nKitchenVitrified Tiles\n\nBathroomVitrified Tiles\n\n### Fitting\n\nMain DoorDoors in Veneer with Melamine Polish\n\nKitchenGranite with Branded SS Sink with Drain Board\n\nElectricalConcealed Copper Electrical Wiring\n\n![down-brouchure](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/down-brouchure-file.svg)\n\n## View Brochure of Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\nExplore complete project insights, layouts,  \n specifications, and more.\n\nView Brochure![View Brochure](https://d1uczv4l7tlcpy.cloudfront.net/assets/image/common-icons-hb.webp)\n\n## Rating of Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\n0\n\n★★★★★★★★★★\n\n(0Reviews)\n\n0Amenity\n\n0Construction\n\n0Green Area\n\n0Connectivity\n\n### About Builder - Paradigm Realty\n\n★★★★★★★★★★\n\nEstablished In -2015Total Projects - 14\n\n[View Details](builders/paradigm-realty)\n\nParadigm Realty was established in 2015, and in a lesser span of time, they were known as modern real estate developers. They have their strong presence in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region (MMR). They majorly focus on delivering homes that combine luxury with affordability, making premium living accessible. Paradigm Realty has developed various projects across Mumbai and Thane that include Paradigm Alaya, Paradigm Antalya, Paradigm 71 Midtown, Paradigm Artteza, etc. Paradigm Realty s vision is to expand their business globally to enhance the everyday lifestyles of individuals. Currently Paradigm Realty has multiple ongoing and completed projects across Mumbai, and in the future they want to transform old housing societies into future-ready communities. They want to balance affordable luxury with functional designs. Paradigm Realty has a massive 4,500 crore redevelopment initiative across 11 housing societies in Bandra and Kandivali. They have quickly established themselves and built trustworthy relationships with customers by specialising in affordable luxury housing that blends with smart design and efficient use of space.\n\n## FAQs about Paradigm Ariana Residency\n\n## Questions & Answers aboutParadigm Ariana Residency\n\n### Q: Is there a community hall?\n\nA: Yes\n\nDisclaimer: While Homebazaar.com takes all steps to ensure accuracy of the information provided in this section, please check the same with the developers. Homebazaar.com does not take responsibility for any discrepancies in the information provided.\n\n### Price Insights of Borivali\n\n### Here are some key pointers based on the graph:\n\n**1.Location :**  The graph represents property price insights for Tata Power Residential Colony, Borivali.\n\n**2.Timeframe :**  The data covers the years 2017 and 2026.\n\n**3.Price per sqft :** \n\n2017: ₹17,200 Sq.ft\n\n2018: ₹18,400 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)\n\n2019: ₹19,000 Sq.ft (increase by 3.3%)\n\n2020: ₹19,150 Sq.ft (marginal increase by 0.8%)\n\n2021: ₹20,350 Sq.ft (increase by 6.3%)\n\n2022: ₹20,550 Sq.ft (marginal increase by 1%)\n\n2023: ₹28,150 Sq.ft (increase by 37%)\n\n2024: ₹29,350 Sq.ft (increase by 4.3%)\n\n2025: ₹30,700 Sq.ft (increase by 4.6%)\n\n2026: ₹32,849 Sq.ft (increase by 7%)\n\n**4.Trend :**  The property prices in Tata Power Residential Colony, Borivali increased by 91% over the period 2017 to 2026\n\n#### About Borivali, Mumbai\n\nAlthough surrounded by Sanjay Gandhi Forest, Borivali is known for its excellent road networks in Mumbai. Top schools and hospitals, including Ajmera Global School, Dr S. Radhakrishnan International School, Witty International School, JBCN International School, Punit Orthopedic & General Hospital, Don Bosco High School, Apex Superspeciality Hospital, United Multispeciality Hospital, Orchids International School, Shree Ganesha Multispeciality Hospital, Vardann Multispecialty Hospital, and Swami Vivekanand International School, are nearby. The neighbourhood is home to prominent corporates, including Suashish IT Park, Mindspace, NESCO IT Park and Expound Technivo, all within the vicinity. The area is known for its outstanding connectivity. The project provides effortless access to the Western Express Highway, Swami Vivekanand Road and the New Link Road, connecting to the commercial hub of Mumbai. Promising infrastructure, such as the Coastal Road and the Thane-Borivali tunnel, will cut the travel time for working professionals. Borivali Railway Station, Kandivali Railway Station, Shimpoli Metro Station, Magathane Metro Station and Borivali West Metro Station offer easy commutes to all parts of Mumbai. The top entertainment options, including Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Kanheri Caves, Indraprastha Shopping Centre, Manori Beach, Gilbert Hill, Raghuleela Mega Mall, etc., offer lavish lifestyles.\n\nRead More About the Locality\n\n#### Similar Projects Nearby in Borivali, Mumbai\n\n[![Oberoi Sky City](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a5b57a28ac64_oberoi-sky-city-elevation2.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### Oberoi Sky City\n\nPrice On Request](oberoi-sky-city-borivali-1828)[![Veena Celestia](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a61dc581ae18_veena-celestia-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### Veena Celestia\n\nPrice On Request](veena-celestia-borivali-8152)[![Chandak Greenairy](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a702f1357082_chandak-greenairy-borivali-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### Chandak Greenairy\n\nPrice On Request](chandak-greenairy-borivali-5857)[![CCI Rivali Park Moonrise](https://ik.imagekit.io/sjnshacs8/propertygallery/6a951e860535b_cci-rivali-park-moonrise-elevation.webp?tr=w-112,h-72)\n\n##### CCI Rivali Park Moonrise\n\nPri