ntial\n\n### 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Devipada\n\nresidential\n\nAriana Residency\n\n85 L1 BHKFully Furnished\n\nBy **Agent** • 30/08/2026\n\nA furnished 1BHK flat is available for sale in Ariana Residency, located in Devipada, Borivali East. The flat has a carpet area of 371 square feet and is situated on a middle floor in a 23-story building that is 5 years old. It includes one car parking space and faces North-East. The asking price is 85 Lakhs, which is negotiable. Additional information and a full inventory list are available on the provided website.\n\n## Locality & Connectivity\n\nleisure\n\n1nearby\n\n* Sanjay Gandhi National Park\n\n  5 min\n\ntransit\n\n1nearby\n\n* Magathane Bus Depo\n\n  5 min\n\nutility\n\n1nearby\n\n* Sai - Dham Temple\n\n  15 min\n\n## Top Agents for Ariana Residency\n\n[![Pro icon](/assets/svg/pro-icon.svg)Add me to this project](/dashboard/top-agent)\n\nNo top agents listed yet for this project.\n\nBe the first one to get featured as a top agent.\n\n## About the Developer\n\nParadigm Realty\n\nDeveloper / Promoter\n\n### Project Overview\n\nPrice per Sq.ft.\n:   ₹ 14179 - ₹ 16923\n\nPossession\n:   January 2023\n\nLaunch Date\n:   August 2017\n\nTotal Area\n:   2224 Acres\n\nTotal Units\n:   300\n\nUnit Sizes\n:   378 - 382 sq.ft.\n\nVerified Deals. Expert Brokers. Zero Guesswork.\n\nAI-powered matching meets India's most trusted broker network. Buy or sell property with complete confidence.\n\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)Buy or Sell with Confidence\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)Instant Match, Faster Deals\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)India's Largest Verified Network\n\n![Trust Banner Icon](/assets/svg/verified-properties-graphic.svg)\n\n## Your Dream Property Starts Here\n\nFill out the form and let PropHunt.ai match you with the perfect commercial or residential space in Ariana Residency\n\n* Verified Properties Only\n* Direct Builder Connection\n* Free Site Visit Assistance\n* Best Price Guarantee\n\n## Discover nearby projects around Ariana Residency\n\n![Magathane Press Enclave Chsl](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Magathane Press Enclave Chsl\n\nby DHARIWAL DEVELOPERS (INDIA) PVT.LTD.\n\nresidential\n\nMagathane, Borivali East\n\n85 L - 2 CrFeb 20271, 2 BHK\n\nDeveloped by DHARIWAL DEVELOPERS (INDIA) PVT.LTD.. Spread across 0.24 acre(s).\n\n![Borivali Keshav Co-operative Housing Society Ltd.](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Borivali Keshav Co-operative Housing Society Ltd.\n\nby S D Khandelwal Developers\n\nresidential\n\nRaheja Estate, Borivali East\n\n2 Cr - 3 CrSep 20252, 3 BHK\n\nDeveloped by S D Khandelwal Developers. Spread across 1050 acre(s).\n\n![Monte Verita West Tower](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Monte Verita West Tower\n\nby B.G. Shirke Redevelopment And Gas Pvt. Ltd.\n\nresidential\n\nMagathane, Borivali East\n\n1 Cr - 5 CrMar 20272, 3 BHK\n\nDeveloped by B.G. Shirke Redevelopment And Gas Pvt. Ltd.. Spread across 5 acre(s). Has 100 units offering from 2bhks of 1000 sqft to 3bhks of 1500 sqft.\n\n![Parijat Hill View Realty Llp](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Parijat Hill View Realty Llp\n\nby SHIRKET™ GROUP OF COMPANIES\n\nresidential\n\nGulmohar Society, Borivali\n\n99 L - 1 CrJun 20241, 2 BHK\n\nDeveloped by SHIRKET™ GROUP OF COMPANIES. Spread across 1 acre(s).\n\n![Parijat Height](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Parijat Height\n\nby kanaklaxmi developers\n\nresidential\n\nGulmohar Society, Borivali\n\n99 L - 1 CrDec 20202 BHK\n\nDeveloped by kanaklaxmi developers. Spread across 0.11 acre(s).\n\n![Ava Maple](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Ava Maple\n\nby AVA LifeSpaces\n\nresidential\n\nKulupwadi, Borivali\n\n80 L - 1 CrDec 20281, 2 BHK\n\nDeveloped by AVA LifeSpaces. Spread across 2 acre(s).\n\n![Sky Villa](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Sky Villa\n\nby Aviyana Real Estate\n\nresidential\n\nWestern Urban Road, Borivali East\n\n4 Cr - 9 CrDec 20206 BHK\n\nDeveloped by Aviyana Real Estate. Spread across 25 acre(s).\n\n![Sky City](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Sky City\n\nby Oberoi Realty\n\nresidential\n\nWestern Urban Road, Borivali East\n\n4 Cr - 6 CrDec 2024\n\nDeveloped by Oberoi Realty. Spread across 25 acre(s).\n\n![Savana](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Savana\n\nby VICEROY PROPERTIES\n\nresidential\n\nDattapada Road, Borivali East\n\n0.127 acre(s)Jun 20272, 3 BHK\n\nDeveloped by VICEROY PROPERTIES. Spread across 0.127 acre(s).\n\n![Esspee Tower](/assets/images/no-listing-image-portrait.webp)\n\n### Esspee Tower\n\nby Bhatia Builders & Developers\n\nresidential\n\nDattapada Road, Borivali\n\n1 Cr - 2 CrJun 20272 BHK\n\nDeveloped by Bhatia Builders & Developers. Spread across 1 acre(s). Has 227 units offering from 2bhks of 720 sqft.\n\n### Properties for Sale\n\n* [Studio Apartments for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/studio-apartment-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [1 BHK Flats for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [2 BHK Flats for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [4 BHK Flats for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [5 BHK Flats for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [Commercial Spaces for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/commercial-space-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [Office Spaces for Sale in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/office-for-sale-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n\n### Properties for Rent\n\n* [Studio Apartments for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/studio-apartment-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [1 BHK Flats for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [2 BHK Flats for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [4 BHK Flats for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [5 BHK Flats for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [Commercial Spaces for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/commercial-space-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n* [Office Spaces for Rent in Ariana Residency](/mumbai/office-for-rent-in-ariana-residency-borivali)\n\n## More about this Location\n\nWhere is Magathane located in Mumbai?\n\nMagathane is a prominent locality situated in Borivali East, Mumbai. It is strategically positioned near the Western Express Highway, offering excellent connectivity to various parts of Mumbai and Thane. It's also close to the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, providing a green environment and a serene escape from the city's hustle.\n\nWhat are the key residential and lifestyle amenities available in Magathane?\n\nMagathane boasts a well-developed social infrastructure with numerous schools like St. John's High School and Ryan International School, and colleges such as Thakur College of Science and Commerce. Residents have access to hospitals like Arihant Superspeciality Hospital, various shopping centers, and recreational spaces like Veer Savarkar Udyan, ensuring a comfortable lifestyle.\n\nHow is the connectivity and public transport in Magathane?\n\nMagathane offers excellent connectivity. The Magathane Metro Station and Poisar Metro Station provide easy access via the Mumbai Metro network. It's also well-served by BEST buses from Borivali National Park Bus Station and is close to Borivali Railway Station, a major suburban rail hub. The Western Express Highway is easily accessible, facilitating road travel.\n\nWhat is the real estate market like in Magathane, Borivali East?\n\nThe real estate market in Magathane, Borivali East, is vibrant, offering a mix of residential properties from 1 BHK to 3 BHK apartments. It's a sought-after location due to its connectivity, amenities, and proximity to commercial hubs. Property values are generally on the higher side, reflecting its prime location and demand within Mumbai's real estate landscape.\n\nWhat are some popular residential projects in Magathane, Borivali East?\n\nMagathane and its immediate vicinity feature several notable residential projects. Rustomjee Pinnacle by Rustomjee offers premium 3 BHK flats. Other significant developments include Chandak GreenAiry by CHANDAK, offering 1 & 2 BHK residences, and Metro Millennium by Metro, providing modern 2 BHK living spaces with various amenities, catering to diverse housing needs.\n\nAre there any upcoming or recently launched projects in Magathane?\n\nYes, the area continues to see new developments. Triumph Ventures' Omkareshwar offers 2 BHK apartments, while Nakasha Group's Apurva Vaishali CHSL provides 1, 2, 3 BHK options. Mahindra Lifespaces also has Mahindra Marina64 - Phase 1 nearby, adding to the diverse housing options with possession by Dec 2029, reflecting ongoing growth in the locality.\n\nWhat are the main advantages of living in Magathane?\n\nLiving in Magathane offers the advantage of excellent urban connectivity combined with proximity to green spaces like Sanjay Gandhi National Park. It provides a balanced lifestyle with access to top educational institutions, healthcare facilities, shopping, and entertainment. Its strategic location makes it ideal for families and professionals seeking convenience and quality living in Mumbai.\n\nWhat kind of educational institutions are available in and around Magathane?\n\nMagathane is well-served by reputable educational institutions. Notable schools include St. John's High School, St. Lawrence High School Kandivali, and Ryan International School Kandivali, offering quality primary and secondary education. For higher education, Thakur College of Science and Commerce Kandivali is a prominent option, catering to diverse academic needs for students in the area.\n\n## Explore Projects in Popular Locations near Ariana Residency\n\n### Education\n\n* St Johns High School Thane0.8 km\n* St Lawrence High School Kandivali1.4 km\n* Ryan International School Kandivali1.4 km\n* Thakur College Of Science And Commerce Kandivali2.2 km\n* St Francis Institute Of Technology Sfit Borivali2.4 km\n* St Francis Dassisi High School Borivali2.6 km\n* St Lawrence High School Borivali2.7 km\n\n### Business\n\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali2.2 km\n* Infinity Park Malad East5.2 km\n* Oberoi Garden City Goregaon East5.8 km\n* Oberoi Commerz Goregaon East6.0 km\n\n### Hospital\n\n* Arihant Superspeciality Hospital1.6 km\n* Apex Hospitals Borivali1.9 km\n* Karuna Hospital Borivali2.4 km\n* Esis Hospital Kandivali2.7 km\n* Namaha Healthcare Kandivali3.5 km\n* Thunga Hospital Malad3.9 km\n* Lifeline Hospital Malad4.0 km\n\n### Transit\n\n* Borivali National Park Bus Station0.7 km\n* Magathane Metro Station0.8 km\n* Borivali East Metro Station1.1 km\n* Ovari Pada2.1 km\n* Poisar Metro Station2.3 km\n* Dahisar East Metro Station3.0 km\n* Kandivali East Metro Station3.3 km\n\n### Lifestyle\n\n* Veer Savarkar Udyan Borivali1.7 km\n* Growel's 101 Kandivali2.5 km\n* Savitribai Phule Udyan Kandivali West3.2 km\n* Fame Adlabs Kandivali3.7 km\n* Essel World Gorai Ferry4.6 km\n* Brihanmumbai Municipal Corporation Liberty Garden4.8 km\n* Infiniti Mall Malad5.6 km\n\n### Locality\n\n* Magathane0.5 km\n* Borivali East0.8 km\n* Borivali Station Area1.1 km\n* Thakur Complex1.7 km\n* Thakur Village1.7 km\n* Borivali West2.1 km\n* Shimpoli2.5 km\n\n[![PropHunt logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Flogo-transperant.webp&w=64&q=75)PropHunt AI](/)\n\n[Log In](/projects/ariana-residency-borivali?login=1)[Post a Listing](/projects/ariana-residency-borivali?login=1&return=%2F