ist.com/Amenities/c5ff02d8-a3e5-4cd4-b5e2-d9807179ee7a.png)\n\nMaintenance and House Keeping\n\n![Parking](https://content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/33e0e2c8-880f-4a4f-9de1-7aff89d64c7e.png)\n\nParking\n\n![Rain Water Harvesting](https://content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/2e6e2dd2-8bbe-46b8-87e2-a0f637c9a464.png)\n\nRain Water Harvesting\n\n![Temple](https://content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/8a1c07b9-c6f7-4894-96e6-8fc90b2d8790.png)\n\nTemple\n\n![Wifi](https://content.thepropertist.com/Amenities/4aba6014-dbe9-4985-850a-74a677b8c880.png)\n\nWifi\n\n**Project Highlight:**\n\n* Podium Garden\n* Yoga & Meditation Zone\n* Amphitheatre\n* Automated Multilevel Parking System\n* WI-FI Enabled Health Club\n* Double Height Air-Conditioned Lobby\n\n### Paradigm Ariana Residency Location\n\n* [Nearby Businesses](#Highlights)\n* [Bus Stops](#BusStops)\n* [Schools](#Schools)\n* [Hospitals](#Hospitals)\n\n* Western Express Highway\n* 1 km\n* Proposed National Park Metro Station\n* 5 mins\n* Sanjay Gandhi National Park\n* 5 mins\n* Megathane Bus Depot\n* 5 mins\n* Temple and Religous Places\n* 5 mins\n* Malls & Entertainment Places\n* 15 mins\n\n## Home Loan & EMI Calculator\n\nSelect A Unit\n\nLoan Amount ( ₹ )\n\nLoan Tenure (in Years)\n\nInterest Rate (P.A.)\n\nMonthly EMI: ₹ 0\n\n## Q&A\n\n#### Enter Details\n\nPlease enter your details to start Q&A\n\n#### Download Brochure\n\n#### Get Location Details\n\n## Request Details\n\n#### Verify Contact Details\n\n#### Additional Details\n\nInterested In Site Visit\n\n[submit](javascript:;)\n\n### Thank You!\n\nThe Advertiser will get in touch with you shortly!\n\n## Similar Properties\n\n[![Chandak Passcode Revolution](//content.thepropertist.com/Projects/Images/449f8a03-d5b1-43bf-a927-944503b27920.jpg)\n\n### Chandak Passcode Revolution\n\nWestern Suburbs, Borivali East\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\n368 - 583 Sq ft.\n\n### Rs. 76 Lacs Onwards](chandak-passcode-revolution-in-borivali-east-113)\n\n[![Rivali Park](//content.thepropertist.com/P